-- a digest is injective when equal digests force identity of the molecules: this, and only this, is
-- what licenses reading identity off a string (InChIKey, canonical SMILES, a registry number)
DigestInjective : (D : Type 0) → (Mol → D) → Type 1
DigestInjective D d = (M : Mol) → (N : Mol) → d M ≡ d N → M ≡ N
